    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so 500mg of green tea is the study range, and i can handle a lot of caffeine. if i wanted to really maximize the effect for a short period, like a two week blast, could i push those numbers higher? like if i did 800mg of green tea extract along with maybe 600mg of caffeine in the morning to get that metabolic spike? would that be too much or is that still in the realm of what someone with a high tolerance can do?",
