      "content": "Taking such high doses for an extended period, even if your tolerance is high, presents significant health risks. Consuming 800mg of green tea extract plus 600mg of caffeine is well above standard recommendations and could potentially lead to serious adverse effects. It is strongly advised to prioritize sustainable and safe habits over short-term metabolic spikes. Please see a qualified healthcare provider to discuss safe and effective strategies.",
